    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Now notice that if $ \\sigma_{s}^{2}=0 $, the denominators of Equations 18.17a and 18.17b are the same, in which case their ratio is simply $ SS_{s}/SS_{e} $. Recalling that $ SS_{x}/df_{x}=MS_{x} $,",
